Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all that juicy ocean water!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Director Scorching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the epitome of extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does she lug this around\Nwithout throwing out her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's child's play for someone\Nwith the blessing of weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What even is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, it means she can alter\Nthe weight of anything she touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can make stuff lighter or\Nheavier whenever she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes hauling junk a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I take it you refused\NCaptain Carriol's invitation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and disappeared into the\Nocean to get away from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct, but it's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hunkered down on a\Nnice island. Till that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some special\Nreason you were hunkered?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for him\Nto return to my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's that\Nbastard who left you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:00:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some clams never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know in my heart\Nhe'll come back one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll return to pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clinging to the memory of a man\Nwho abandoned her without remorse,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's deluded herself into believing\Nthey'll see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, that loser was a\Nbonafide marriage fraudster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.78,0:01:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she refuses to believe us no matter\Nhow many times we try to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the captain came\Nto invite me, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Sulrin, a snow spirit like Kikoyu\Nwhose allegiance lies with the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The snowstorms she conjures\Nare no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have our work cut out for\Nus without Kikoyu around to back us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why Director Bear sent\Nsomeone along to aid the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a dog's age since I've\Nbeen to the Dog Mountain Stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't hold a candle\Nto the scorching sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be real, it's\Nlukewarm and best out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think this was\Nsome cruel prank, care of the bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meekaboo, are you getting\Nenough nutrition in that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some food would cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a living drum kit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's the life of the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can give me a kid if you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are about as\Ncompatible as fire and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.99,0:02:28.91,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,Boxxo,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.01,0:03:21.47,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1)\fscx59\pos(432.8,55.4)}The Clam and the Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He poured fuel on the flame\Nof her shut-in tendencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went, sir-um-sir-what-eeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, thank you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a peculiar magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real person, I can already tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have thunk a\Nclam in a vending machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would get along so well\Nand yet here we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I managed\Nto cheer her up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cause trouble for everyone around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that especially goes for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's a liar, but I still\Ncan't bring myself to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so self-centered, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A truly terrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it could be you earned,\Nfor instance, if you went.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I'm only good at defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think they'd want\Nsomeone like me around? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the evil. Evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You believe in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, maybe I'll\Ntry just a bit harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clam is emerging from her shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta come taste\Nthat salty sea air with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure that's going to\Nhelp her want to open up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that combo is a\Npretty darn good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there, that's my\Nisland. It's still too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away to really see\Nanything we can do better
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than that form change tourist destinations
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,often have binocular\Nrentals i know they're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not packaged goods but i've been able to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,change into service\Nmachines since reaching rank
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two i could wax poetic about the different
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,types but we're short\Non time so i'll refrain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wow everything's crystal clear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I see the fool's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was starting to worry about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the makeshift entourage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy cast an illusion on us\Nto protect our identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're total strangers\Nand an adorable kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea monsters, they've\Nbeen causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I hired bodyguards. Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need all the offensive\Nhelp you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join our party, Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going at a snail's pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conquering the dungeon would be\Na breeze with you on defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for him to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can't go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we only ask that\Nyou give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once this dungeon is handled,\Nwe'll do what we can to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll even help you track\Ndown your long-lost lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Still a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go with you. I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to wreck your little house\Nby starting a nasty brawl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:06:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:06:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems the gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, how about we indulge in some booze\Nwhile we work through our differences?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind some of Bokso's finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We miss his deep-fried meats and\Ndelightfully fizzy drinks so much it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't we, Shiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it\Nmakes me hungry and thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's been\Nforever, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare look at me\Nwith those wistful eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten,\Nwe're enemies at the Mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're clearly jonesing to fight. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La-I-X-R-E-T.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We surveyed a hundred people\Nin the Clearflow Lake Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and asked what they think of\NCaptain Carriol's actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas and I collected a\Nfew choice opinions about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Menagerie of Fools\Nfor just such an occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of them working for the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Netherlord in order to\Nhelp a child in need?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had three options\Nthey could choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgivable, unforgivable, and undecided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twelve people said forgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sixty said unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And twenty-eight said undecided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not nearly as\Nbad as I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who said forgivable\Nhad something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all said things like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's possible I would do the same thing\Nif I thought it would help my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or, as a parent, I can't judge\Nwithout knowing the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds tragic. Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Filmina deserves\Nbetter than Captain Kerrioll?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to\Nread that one out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't judge stuff when she's\Ngetting in the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to hold him tighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,62 said definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,16 said perfect mismatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And 22 said, "Hope he dies." That's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those the choices anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone seems to be in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should have searched longer\Nto find a more suitable husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the final question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they ever came back and\Napologized and accepted punishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you forgive them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment of truth has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the whole reason we went polling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty said I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And eighty said I'd forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That result isn't all that\Nsurprising when you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time, they've been\Nfocused on clearing the lowest floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they haven't directly hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the folks in the Clear Flow\NLake Stratum are kind and open-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously, they learned to embrace\Na freaking talking vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a sample of what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should have known that we would have\Nhad their backs if they were in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they weren't so stupid, we\Ncould have pitched in to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just come back already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay for the booze and we'll let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the most natural thing in the world\Nfor a parent to want to protect their kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's important to remember that\Nevery action has a ripple effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what your child\Nwould want for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to knock some sense\Ninto those empty heads of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell those whippersnappers\Nto hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, I'd say those\Nlast two are Yumite and Shimelai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're filled with\Nregret for not realizing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how much the captain and\Nhis wife were suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all busybodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and here's one for\Nyou from Miss Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've heard\Nenough for today, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to read that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, you've got a record-setting\Ntab, so please come and pay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The young ladies of our fine establishment\Nmiss your company, as well as that of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akka and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, don't keep us waiting. XOXO!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care to explain yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell what it sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boys were curious about the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They practically dragged me, kicking and\Nscreaming, so they could have a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really have a\Nchoice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her the truth, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who made us promise\Nnot to tell Mom about our field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your idea, and you kept\Nbragging about how you're a regular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your drinks were more enjoyable\Nwith pretty ladies by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you had the time of\Nyour life there, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably intervene\Nbefore things get violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's pretty obvious\Nwho's behind this attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you finished blabbing\Nabout your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope you're not\Nconsidering betraying the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dream of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The debt we owe is too steep for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a blast, but the reunion's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean he owes\Nthe Netherlord a debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to stay and chat\Nabout the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had crossed paths sooner, things\Nmay have turned out differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gone past the point of no return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can find a\Nway to save your son,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even without asking the\Nstupid Netherlord to help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so naive it's amusing you think\Nthey're still worried about saving their son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to report that's not\Na concern of theirs anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying it's time\Nfor show and tell it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the captain's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo boxo boxo i'm taking excellent\Ncare of his darling little boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(479,130)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's no longer any\Nneed to remove the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have taken it upon myself to\Nrelieve this sweet child of his pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when can you remove curses?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a snow spirit thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beheading a snow spirit who\Nhas blossomed into adulthood
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transforms them into a statue\Nthat can remove curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what do you suppose happens if one\Nmanages to keep her head on her shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:13:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ability to remove curses is a\Ntalent that is inherent to my kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we mature, our abilities\Ncontinue to grow along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only catch is that the\Ntarget must remain near.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you attempt to pry this child from my\Ngrasp, his excruciating pain will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically you're holding a kid hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boy isn't a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saving the captain's precious\Nson from a wretched existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This family wishes to satisfy my\Nevery whim as a show of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm afraid we have no\Nchoice but to serve the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Netherlord and fight to clear\Nthe dungeon on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made your choice, and nothing\Nwe say could make you change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the only option\Nleft to us is to use force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just another sad Netherlord crony.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't expect a shred of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love makes fools of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hurting others, even for\Nlove, that's just despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but notice\Nyour short one-snow spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meaning none of you are\Ncapable of stopping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:14:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from turning everyone\Nstanding here to ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kind of personal,\Nso why not let us handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you mean to defy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so cruel?\NThat was stupid! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better than I think it's\Nabout time we end this farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill every\Nlast one of you. How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better split up so she can't\Nhit us all at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough to hear\Nwith your dirty tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the people fighting aren't getting\Nfired up, it's not a real battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you an actual imbecile?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought it was a good idea to charge\Na snow spirit without any forethought?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was barely lukewarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow spirits are lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all cold as ice and boring to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have assumed your\Nrace already died off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:14:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a true annoyance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flame spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come no one gave us the heads-up,\NDirector Scorching's a flame spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Hulemy? I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also know their powers are essentially\Nthe opposite of the snow spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you might have guessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can control fire\Nand can be a bit hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Snow Spirit's natural enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their people have fought countless wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains why Director\NVare chose him for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With flame powers, he can\Ngo toe-to-toe with Sulream!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Queen's mine, so sit\Nback and enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This measly battleground's\Nnot gonna cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess there's no use to\Nlaying the inevitable captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time will be different than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dead serious about\Nwalking away the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are about to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I request to be the one to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll focus on the vice captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat up his stupid Osprey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid, you loudmouthed loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children, it seems the time has\Ncome to reveal our true forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vice-captain has vamp fiend\Nblood flowing through her veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, that's kinda badass, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, with those wings, she looks\Nmore like a fallen angel than a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we let the battle begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Filmina exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't explode anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She conjured a water double to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real her is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a noble effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your amusing attacks are\Nyou're absolutely fearsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, I can simply fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't used to have a way to fight\Nairborne enemies, but that was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out this transformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coin locker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's OWN!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went ahead and blocked these bottled\Nbeauties from entering my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forgot I can control water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not ordinary water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I've felt this\Nslimy texture before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was back in the origin straddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lubricant, gently-scented\Nlotion. Oh, no. My wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid you're still\Nno match for my water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That went surprisingly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's killing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must you attack poor Pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The woman who stole my\Nman put you up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity won't give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle just started and she's\Nalready come up with her own head cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's starting to look like\Nwe'll have to buy some
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time until Dad or Sulream\Ncan come and bail us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat them if they run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came prepared for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How inspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know what you're planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock it. Charge. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not our best moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat us with\Na bevy of busty ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you! That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, that was gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I the one who's in hot water?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those eyes of yours,\Nthey're quite troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Colour me impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm not getting\Nanything by you, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm reading the room correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems his eye breach ability\Ndoes more than just break blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was feeling pretty confident\Nwe would win this battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you guys are making me work for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop the captain, even if\Nit means I have to play the villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really like the sound\Nof this, but you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love me some fizzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do you think you can try to be a bit\Nmore gentle with the execution next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know they say when\Nsomeone is unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good practice to remove their shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to ensure they don't get overheated?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He already picked up on the\Nthreat I'm trying to lay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I regret that I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not unconscious, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate being on this\Nside of a Boxxo battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The feeling is mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go all out with that brat around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does make this complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be extremely hard\Nfor anyone who isn't armed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with magic or special blessings\Nto fight in that dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe he's using Eye Breach\Nto cancel out the blizzard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be the area of effect\Nfor his Eye Breach power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight is going nowhere fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop goofing off and put out those flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a dire situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's moving close enough\Nto put out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look, she's utterly\Ndistracted at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our chance to\Ncatch them off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty much doomed\Nif we don't act fast. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you to stay here, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't risk taking Filmina\Nand the others along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen this trick before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like when they ran away\Nin the scorching sand stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrier! I preach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My vending senses are tingling like mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're actually the one\Nwe were after all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.76,0:22:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up. Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.67,0:23:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you. I'm waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you to feel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see you, I can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see you. I can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,,0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs17.4\fscx70\pos(466.2,295.8)}A Stay in Enemy Territory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

